<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-17T14:45:01.516Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:45:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese Armed Forces have seized Al-Khuwai and five other sites in West Kordofan and are advancing toward Al-Nahud while reinforcing the Blue Nile front, increasing pressure on the Rapid Support Forces. The RSF continues to conduct drone strikes on civilian populations and power stations, causing darkness and civilian casualties, including children. A Rapid Support Forces field commander defected to the SAF and a former RSF adviser was released in Chad, while a former Sudanese information minister was attacked in Uganda. A former Sudanese official wanted by the ICC was arrested, confirming U.S. involvement. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNUzVVZlh0cUIxWFBYU2NGYnZWdHZmc1RLY3oyNm51NTlQQjJEMFlVclNsN2tWM0FjMmRycVdsMXQ2WW4xeUJZYVR1V3lac2ZBTmJ4RWcxYXVxaFlGV1dNbXM3OG5FOXhheVdiM0dzUVktZnJZZkQxNUU4ZWZuM0lWV2JyZXVKUXZtcDl2RHVaTVRtRGN1ZFdPckdPQ0dZSFI1SDVfVGlPbWhYa0o0alNCNFdsSDgtUkhxakRWZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQU3NNZ2xhbHJYaE5ieHVqaEZMQm1FMHFfc0ZZM1ZQbWhLT0xadlhZSHh1cnJKUFZkbnNtM0JBd0preGl1S2VpR2hwa05JZ2RzZXB5WVJjSHRHNmdjTGFPSEVBQTlGR3NtN1NWaXZYZmhJVkRxUDA5a01lMGtVTXJyVXd4bFE0QU5PMzdTSU5OVUhTVUE2aUV2RW5tb1dGeTJRc1BWNk8zWUdJZmh1TEVFbjQwdV8?oc=5&quot;&gt;IOL&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOMnNkazhYNGNUbklRem9XUHlYcWJDLVR4eHpRcktSTDVtZHpvSjh3c2xqcUg5TVZyOTR4N1FNQldlV196a1JKRnEyV1VKVzJEOWZCM1MyaUtvYzVLcHBfMkZMSW4zbE05WmRQMER1NzEtTm9tbG1zQnBOd0pTX1NDQWZfcFI1eFR0bm43MWRzMHhpOWpYVzhDWEd4NlRVTVhXa3V3X3JhZThXNmxrR2xNeHlmaGczMy16S2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dabanga Radio